  "title": "Traditional Pfefferneusse",
  "description": "Family recipe for German peppernuts. Small, dense spice cookies that are tantalizing when dipped in coffee, or great on their own. This is the traditional version with molasses.",
  "authors": [
    "DANICASB"
  ],
